# ==============================================================================
# SRI SRI UNIVERSITY (SSU) IT CLUB — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================
# Zero Budget Guarantee: All services used here have 100% permanently free tiers
# with zero payment information or credit card required.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. SUPABASE DATABASE & REALTIME AUTH (Free Tier: 500MB DB, 50k MAU)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# How to get free credentials:
# 1. Sign up for free at https://supabase.com (no credit card needed).
# 2. Create a new project.
# 3. Go to Project Settings -> API.
# 4. Copy "Project URL" and "anon public" key below.
# 5. Run the `supabase_setup.sql` script in your Supabase SQL Editor.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. ADMIN PORTAL PASSCODE
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Private master passcode for initial emergency super-admin unlock.
VITE_ADMIN_PASSCODE=SSUITCLUB@2026

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. WEB3FORMS EMAIL DISPATCH (Optional - Free Tier: 250 emails/month)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# How to get your free access key in 10 seconds:
# 1. Visit https://web3forms.com
# 2. Enter your university or club email (e.g. itclub@university.edu).
# 3. Check your inbox for the free Access Key (no password, no credit card!).
# 4. Paste the key below.
# Note: If left blank, the website automatically falls back to archiving contact
# inquiries in Supabase and local storage so no student message is ever lost.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=

# ==============================================================================
# 4. ZERO-KEY PUBLIC APIS (ALREADY PRE-INTEGRATED & ACTIVE)
# ==============================================================================
# The following services do NOT require any API keys or configuration:
# - Open-Meteo Weather API: https://api.open-meteo.com/ (Campus weather)
# - QR Server API: https://api.qrserver.com/ (Scannable ticket passes)
# - Dev.to REST API: https://dev.to/api/ (Global Tech Wire articles)
# - OpenStreetMap Tile Service: https://www.openstreetmap.org/ (Campus maps)
# - ipapi.co Geolocation: https://ipapi.co/ (Auto visitor country & dialing codes)
